1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:03,600
Stay back! I have a frying pan, and I
know how to use it.

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:10,067
A tiny old woman. Silver bun. Teal
cardigan. A frying pan up in the air.
And Biscuit wags his tail at her.

3
00:00:10,567 --> 00:00:12,267
Is it... is it really you?

4
00:00:12,767 --> 00:00:16,933
The pan falls. It clangs on the tile.
She puts both hands over her mouth.

5
00:00:17,433 --> 00:00:17,900
Nana.

6
00:00:19,433 --> 00:00:25,633
You got so tall. You got so thin. And
look at your poor little lungs. Sit
down. Sit. I have peppermints.
